### 5.3 Glassmorphism Spec
```css
backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(1.4);
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
border-radius: 24px;
box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
```

### 5.4 Animation Principles

| Element          | Approach                                                          |
|------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Page transitions | Framer Motion â€” fade + slide (y: 20 â†’ 0, opacity 0 â†’ 1)          |
| Scroll reveals   | useInView â€” staggered children entrance                           |
| Hero parallax    | useScroll + useTransform â€” layers at different speeds             |
| Album art        | CSS rotate 20s linear infinite (pauses when stopped)             |
| Visualizer       | requestAnimationFrame + AnalyserNode canvas                       |
| Hover states     | scale(1.04) spring (stiffness: 300, damping: 20)                  |
| Modal / drawer   | AnimatePresence â€” slide up, fade overlay                          |
| Lyrics           | Framer Motion layout â€” active line scales + highlights smoothly   |

