## 6. Pages & Screens

### 6.1 Hero Page â€” `/`

The entry point. Cinematic, scroll-driven, makes an instant impression.

**Sections (top to bottom):**

**Navbar**
- App name "Aura" left, "Open Player" CTA right
- Frosted glass, sticks on scroll

**Hero Section**
- Full viewport height
- Large animated title (staggered letter reveal)
- Animated gradient blob background
- Floating album art cards in parallax
- Tagline fades in after title

**Preview Player Strip**
- Horizontal scroll row of 5â€“8 Pixabay songs
- Click card â†’ plays 30s preview inline
- Mini waveform visualizer on active card
- Card shows: album art, title, artist, genre tag

**Features Showcase**
- 3 animated cards (scroll reveal): Visualizer, Synced Lyrics, Equalizer
- Each with icon, short description, looping micro-animation

**Search Bar**
- Pinned at bottom of hero
- Large, centered, frosted glass input
- Placeholder: "Search your music library..."
- Live results from local library if already loaded
- Enter â†’ navigates to /search

---

### 6.2 Player Page â€” `/player`

The main experience. 3-panel layout.

**Left Panel â€” Playlist Sidebar**
- Logo + "Open Folder" button
- Scrollable song list (staggered entrance animation)
- Active song: glow border + equalizer bar animation
- Song row: thumbnail, title, artist, duration
- Drag to reorder (Framer Motion drag)

**Centre Panel â€” Main Player**
- Background blurs + shifts to dominant album art color
- Rotating album art circle (pauses when stopped)
- Pulsing ring around art when playing
- Song title + artist crossfade on track change
- Seekable progress bar with current/total time
- Controls: Previous Â· Play/Pause (large gradient button) Â· Next
- Secondary: Shuffle Â· Repeat (none/one/all) Â· Volume slider
- Canvas frequency bar visualizer below album art

**Right Panel â€” Lyrics**
- Fetches synced LRC from LRCLIB API
- Active line: highlighted + scaled up (Framer Motion layout)
- Past lines fade, future lines dimmed
- Auto-scrolls to keep active line centred
- Fallback: plain text or "Lyrics not available"

**Bottom Bar â€” Equalizer**
- Toggle to expand/collapse EQ panel (AnimatePresence height)
- 5-band EQ via BiquadFilterNode chain
- Animated spring-physics slider knobs
- Presets: Flat Â· Bass Boost Â· Vocal Â· Electronic Â· Classical

---

### 6.3 Library Page â€” `/library`

Browse the full local song collection.

- Grid view of album art cards + list view toggle (animated)
- Filter: All Â· Albums Â· Artists Â· Recently Added
- Sort: Aâ€“Z Â· Zâ€“A Â· Duration Â· Most Played
- Scroll reveal stagger on card grid (0.05s per card)
- Click album â†’ expands inline to show tracks (height animation)
- Click song â†’ opens Player with that song
- Song count + total duration at top

---

### 6.4 Search Page â€” `/search`

Fast live search across the local library.

- Large hero search input (auto-focused)
- Results appear as user types (debounced 150ms)
- Grouped by: Songs Â· Albums Â· Artists
- Each row: album art, title, artist, duration, play button
- Animated results list (stagger entrance, exit on clear)
- Empty state: animated illustration + "No results for X"
- Recent searches stored in localStorage

