## 7. Feature Specifications

### 7.1 Local Folder Loading
- Native folder picker via `<input webkitdirectory>`
- Reads .mp3, .flac, .wav, .ogg files
- Parses ID3 tags: title, artist, album, year, album art
- Falls back to filename if tags missing
- Embedded album art extracted as Blob URL and treated as poster priority #1
- Song list populates Zustand store
- Last folder path persisted in localStorage

### 7.2 Poster / Artwork Resolution

Aura should never display a blank album card, queue item, or player poster. Artwork resolution runs automatically in this order:

| Priority | Source             | Rule                                                                  |
|----------|--------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| 1        | Embedded ID3 art   | Use immediately if the local audio file already contains cover art    |
| 2        | iTunes Search API  | Search the real track/album and use the best matching official cover  |
| 3        | AI generated poster| Generate a mood-based fallback only when the first two layers fail    |

**iTunes cover lookup**
- Endpoint: `https://itunes.apple.com/search?term={artist} {title}&entity=song&limit=5`
- Match using normalized artist + title first; album name is an extra confidence signal when available
- Upgrade `artworkUrl100` to `600x600` before rendering
- Cache the resolved result by a stable song fingerprint such as `artist|title|album|duration`

**AI fallback poster**
- Provider: Pollinations.ai for v1 because it requires no key and no account setup
- Prompt base: `album cover art, {genre_or_mood}, cinematic, high quality, no text`
- Mood is inferred from `genre` when present; otherwise default to `abstract colorful music`
- Generated art is decorative fallback only and should be tagged internally as `source: ai`

**Genre to mood prompt map**

| Genre      | Prompt direction                                      |
|------------|--------------------------------------------------------|
| Hip-Hop    | Urban street art, dark moody, neon lights             |
| Electronic | Abstract geometric forms, synthwave glow, luminous    |
| Classical  | Elegant marble, renaissance mood, soft golden light   |
| Lo-Fi      | Cozy room, anime-inspired warmth, soft grain          |
| Rock       | Dramatic lightning, dark sky, bold energy             |
| Jazz       | Smoky club, vintage texture, warm amber tones         |

**Artwork resolver contract**
- Client behavior: if embedded art exists, skip network lookup entirely
- API route: `GET /api/artwork?artist=&title=&album=&genre=`
- Response: resolved `source`, `imageUrl`, and optional `prompt` when the fallback is AI-generated
- Fallback safety: if iTunes returns no confident match, do not guess a wrong cover; switch to AI

### 7.3 Audio Visualizer
- Chain: AudioContext â†’ MediaElementSource â†’ AnalyserNode â†’ Destination
- FFT size: 256
- Canvas renders 64 frequency bars
- Bar gradient: accent primary â†’ accent secondary
- 60fps via requestAnimationFrame
- Pauses when song is paused

### 7.4 Synced Lyrics

| Property      | Detail                                                        |
|---------------|---------------------------------------------------------------|
| API           | https://lrclib.net/api/get?artist_name=X&track_name=Y        |
| Format        | LRC (timestamp + text lines)                                  |
| Sync method   | setInterval 250ms checks currentTime vs lyric timestamps      |
| Active line   | Framer Motion layoutId â€” smooth size + opacity transition     |
| Scroll        | scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' })       |
| Fallback      | Plain text if synced not available                            |
| No lyrics     | Friendly empty state with blurred song art background         |

### 7.5 Equalizer Bands

| Band       | Frequency | Effect                  |
|------------|-----------|-------------------------|
| Sub Bass   | 60 Hz     | Depth and rumble        |
| Bass       | 250 Hz    | Body and warmth         |
| Midrange   | 1 kHz     | Vocals and instruments  |
| Presence   | 4 kHz     | Clarity and definition  |
| Brilliance | 12 kHz    | Air and sparkle         |

### 7.6 Keyboard Shortcuts

| Action         | Key                     |
|----------------|-------------------------|
| Play / Pause   | Space                   |
| Next track     | Arrow Right             |
| Previous track | Arrow Left              |
| Seek forward   | Shift + Arrow Right     |
| Seek back      | Shift + Arrow Left      |
| Volume up/down | Arrow Up / Arrow Down   |
| Mute           | M                       |
| Shuffle        | S                       |
| Repeat         | R                       |
| Fullscreen     | F                       |

