### Additional v1 Artwork Modules
- `app/api/artwork/route.ts` -> server-side resolver for iTunes matching and AI fallback selection
- `hooks/useArtwork.ts` -> poster loading state, cache lookup, and fallback orchestration
- `lib/artwork.ts` -> normalization, provider clients, and source selection helpers
- `lib/posterPrompts.ts` -> genre-to-mood prompt mapping for generated posters

## 9. Build Milestones

| Week   | Milestone              | Deliverable                                                          |
|--------|------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Week 1 | Setup + Hero           | Next.js + Tailwind + Framer Motion. Blobs, title animation, navbar.  |
| Week 2 | Preview Strip + Search | Pixabay songs in /public. Preview player. Search bar UI.             |
| Week 3 | Player Core            | Folder loading, metadata, poster fallback pipeline, Howler.js, sidebar, basic controls. |
| Week 4 | Visualizer + EQ        | Web Audio visualizer. BiquadFilter EQ. Presets. Animated sliders.    |
| Week 5 | Lyrics Panel           | LRCLIB API. LRC parser. Synced scroll. Fallbacks.                    |
| Week 6 | Library + Search       | Full library grid. Album expand. Live search with grouping.          |
| Week 7 | Polish + Shortcuts     | Keyboard shortcuts. Page transitions. Performance audit.             |
| Week 8 | Deploy                 | Deploy to Vercel (free). Final polish. Share with friends.           |

